{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本規則依技師法（以下簡稱本法）第十三條第三項規定訂定之。","id":"D0070036/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"283759cbd60621237095c3bd3bdc71441431f0053ee6ca32a36d291adb461073","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":28,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"本規則所稱建築物結構與設備專業工程部分，指依建築法所訂之範圍。","id":"D0070036/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"176a94cac2b362930e23bf29a76538d28bd61802f16cbd95bc76ea74092a688d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":31,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"本規則所稱專業技師，指依本法第八條第一項規定，領有執業執照，並依本法第七條第一項第一款、第二款規定方式執業，辦理建築物結構與設備專業工程之技師。","id":"D0070036/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"46cad71d992f0a73f837959422bb0b3633c374c492dd0815244009b102df8fc6","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":72,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"專業技師辦理建築物結構與設備專業工程相關技術事務並簽證負責（以下簡稱簽證）時，應先檢具下列文件、資料，申經中央主管建築機關許可，並公告後始得為之：\n一、申請書。\n二、執業技師之簽名及印鑑卡、執業圖記。\n三、執業執照及其影本各一份。\n前項許可期限末日與執業執照效期末日相同，執業執照效期屆滿換發後，許可事項無變更者，免重新申請許可。\n執業執照於效期內經撤銷、廢止、註銷或受停止業務懲戒處分者，簽證許可自執業執照撤銷、廢止、註銷生效日或停業期間起始日失其效力；恢復執業者，應依第一項規定重新申請許可。\n專業技師姓名、身分證明文件字號、技師科別、證書字號名稱有變更時，應於變更執業執照後十五日內申報中央主管建築機關辦理變更；其變更事項並由中央主管建築機關公告之。","id":"D0070036/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"b52edaa65062a307036b76d77779843d1627ea5021c35a082e46cea865260772","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":116,"children":[{"id":"D0070036/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":74,"end":81,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070036/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":81,"end":101,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070036/a:4/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":101,"end":116,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070036/a:4/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":116,"end":166,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070036/a:4/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":166,"end":249,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070036/a:4/p:4","kind":"paragraph","number":4,"start":249,"end":328,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"專業技師辦理簽證業務時，應依中央主管建築機關指定項目為之。","id":"D0070036/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"e8f17cb52f0e3293cbc4586785133c21c053bf86a79bc831746aa5b64abdc77e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":29,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"（刪除）","id":"D0070036/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"bcd3802fb362258544f58c9ce653f61fd0319535b923ab633d178745f30ee6d1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":4,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"專業技師對於工作底稿應盡保密及妥善保管之責任，除有關機關依法令調閱，或應委託者要求借閱外，不得洩漏其中任何資料，並應自提出簽證報告之日起，至少保存五年。","id":"D0070036/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"1ee0e5e51dea0c0256e2223d4c6d09a6fe74374f198f8ecf9313e058ff207e9f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":76,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"專業技師執行業務所為之簽證記錄，應每三個月向當地主管建築機關申報。\n各級主管建築機關有疑問時，得向專業技師查詢其簽證紀錄，或調閱有關簽證事實之文件及工作底稿，專業技師不得規避、拒絕或妨礙。","id":"D0070036/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"f4e38877e561d42aa67530a2b7f0474087e036d230b7df2f02443e16997a1c7e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":34,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070036/a:8/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":34,"end":94,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"專業技師辦理簽證業務時，其簽證報告、執行業務所製作之圖樣及書表，應由技師本人簽署，並加蓋技師執業圖記，簽證報告並應載明中央主管建築機關許可文號。","id":"D0070036/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"fd186e7b30aa59ebf324ce99830636c4f6c41f4f3bed7fc7517c181b54218813","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":72,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"依本規則辦理之建築物結構與設備專業工程，其施工必須勘驗部分，應由各該專業技師查核簽章，並依建築法令由承造人會同監造人按時申報，始得繼續施工或報請竣工查驗。","id":"D0070036/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"93d4f7cd0e20ff8a6257f3a8ebbe7c0f9d998c4432dee24a497601b56909e14f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":77,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"專業技師辦理簽證業務時，應與建築物起造人及設計人或監造人訂定書面契約。","id":"D0070036/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"4dabb38384f845569010d9e847023cf558d514e5d1d4aee1652f5db5f65f3d4e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":35,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":[],"text":"專業技師執行簽證業務違反本規則者，除依本法有關規定懲罰外，中央主管建築機關得廢止其簽證許可，並視其情節輕重停止二個月以上三年以下簽證許可之申請。","id":"D0070036/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"393b675d8fac259992a6681eff6d951e2f6ad4055b6da138185a6af8da1a326d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":72,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":[],"text":"本規則自發布日施行。","id":"D0070036/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"c79dd7c8b5fcea352a40cf0829fe2426e41316bddd4c11e29894a9560774511f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070036/a:13/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國八十四年二月二十四日經濟部（84）經工字第 84000031 號令\n  、內政部（84）台內營字第 8472186  號令會銜訂定發布全文 13 條\n2.中華民國八十八年八月十八日經濟部（88）經工字第 88019647 號令、\n  內政部（88）台內營字第 8874126  號令會銜修正發布第 3  條條文\n3.中華民國一百零一年一月十九日行政院公共工程委員會工程技字第 100\n  00480921  號令、內政部台內營字第 1000811620 號令會銜修正發布第\n  1、3、7、9、12  條條文；刪除第 6  條條文\n4.中華民國一百十二年八月十一日行政院公共工程委員會工程技字第 112\n  0200657 號令、內政部台內營字第 1120810295 號令會銜修正發布第 4\n  條條文","id":"D0070036","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2023-08-11","name":"建築物結構與設備專業工程技師簽證規則","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0070036","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"965d28665b6570f625813381d6e40d13e02052f202aad506d5795dd9a3273d79","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2023-08-11","effectiveDate":""}}